/**
 * @mainpage Keyple Plugin Stub C++ Library
 *
 * @section overview Overview
 *
 * The **Keyple Plugin Stub C++ Library** is a Keyple add-on that enables
 * applications to interact with virtual readers and emulated smart cards,
 * ideal for testing and development without physical hardware.
 *
 * @section key_features Key Features
 *
 * - Virtual reader simulation
 * - Smart card emulation
 * - Testing and development support
 * - Configurable card responses
 * - No physical hardware required
 *
 * @section resources Resources
 *
 * - **Documentation**: [keyple.org](https://keyple.org)
 * - **API Documentation**: [docs.keyple.org/keyple-plugin-stub-cpp-lib](https://docs.keyple.org/keyple-plugin-cpp-java-lib)
 * - **Examples**: [github.com/eclipse/keyple-cpp-example](https://github.com/eclipse/keyple-cpp-example)
 */
